WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.340
I'm Dr. Dickson.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:05.520
Many people think cosmetic dentistry starts
with whitening, bonding, or

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.100
veneers. We believe it starts somewhere
else.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.680
It starts with understanding why a smile
looks the way it does.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:16.040
Sometimes teeth appear short, uneven, worn,
or unbalanced.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:20.260
Not because of teeth themselves, but because
of the relationship between the

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:23.840
lips, gums, facial structure, and supporting
tissues.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:28.120
If those elements aren't in harmony, simply
changing the teeth rarely creates

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.860
the most natural or lasting result.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:34.300
That's why we created the Forma Method, a
thoughtful, structured approach

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.040
to smile design that focuses on balance
first and aesthetic second.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.500
Every smile begins with a comprehensive
digital evaluation.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:46.560
We study facial proportions, tooth display,
gum position, smile

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.620
symmetry, and your personal goals to
understand the complete picture before

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:54.800
recommending treatment. When needed, we
refine the foundation surrounding the

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:59.180
smile through precise gum and tissue
contouring, creating balance, symmetry,

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:00.840
and proper proportions.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:05.300
Only then do we consider cosmetic
enhancements such as whitening, bonding,

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:09.780
or veneers. The result is a smile that feels
natural, healthy, and uniquely

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:14.300
yours, not overdone, not trendy, and never
one -size -fits

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:17.940
-all. At Allegra Dental Center, we don't
simply enhance smiles.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:19.560
We restore balance first.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:23.800
That's the Forma Method, and we'd be honored
to help you discover what's

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:24.980
possible for your smile.